{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay The King is a strategy game where you build an army of warriors to go to war against a corrupt king.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.poster.avif?t=1768235718\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.webm?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.mp4?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corrupt king has stolen your land, now you must gather resources to build your own settlements of warriors. Equip your troops with various weapons and build traps to protect your settlements. Once you are strong enough, launch an invasion against the enemy and take out the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.poster.avif?t=1768235718\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.webm?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.mp4?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully destructible environments, physics and fire and water simulation, each level will test your skills and creativity to craft the perfect assault on the enemy and emerge victorious. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911500?t=1768235718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911500?t=1768235718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/930b7af36f0c975e6416e1091cb7d3ef13fc8248/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768235718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/930b7af36f0c975e6416e1091cb7d3ef13fc8248/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768235718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay The King is a strategy game where you build an army of warriors to go to war against a corrupt king.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.poster.avif?t=1768235718\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.webm?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.mp4?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corrupt king has stolen your land, now you must gather resources to build your own settlements of warriors. Equip your troops with various weapons and build traps to protect your settlements. Once you are strong enough, launch an invasion against the enemy and take out the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.poster.avif?t=1768235718\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.webm?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/117fd618032375f6f0a334d99a892683.mp4?t=1768235718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully destructible environments, physics and fire and water simulation, each level will test your skills and creativity to craft the perfect assault on the enemy and emerge victorious. </p>","developers":["Escape Nine Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/83a3ef1aba2879a49c528d3194a32e740ec6b89f/header.jpg?t=1768235718","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911500/474119312/794d86c1c74847275e72908afa2dd6f4db2e5670/1765292651/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765292862","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911500/474119312/794d86c1c74847275e72908afa2dd6f4db2e5670/1765292651/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765292862","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911500/474119312/794d86c1c74847275e72908afa2dd6f4db2e5670/1765292651/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765292862","id":257176906,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176906/53a21d70ce115abf20afd6d5933cf561a60f662a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765292862"}],"name":"Slay The King","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<st